{
  "schema": "starlit.story.optional_midpoint.v1",
  "status": "text_only_not_bound",
  "note": "第25-48章可选证据中途对话；不提前让成年诺依或维莎加入。",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "ch025.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch025",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch025.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch025.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "船坞守夜人",
          "text": "这艘旧船修过太多次，最后一任船工连工钱都没领完。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch025.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "朔弦",
          "text": "先把欠薪列清。我们买船不应该顺手接过旧船主的借口。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch026.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch026",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch026.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch026.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "岛上邮差",
          "text": "每年我都把退回的信按姓氏摆好，怕有一天有人来问。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch026.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "你保留的不是一堆废纸，是仍然可以重新确认的归途。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch027.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch027",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch027.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch027.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "潜水工",
          "text": "海底那册书写着今日有孩子出生，旁边的钟却记着同一天城门封闭。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch027.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "岚音",
          "text": "先确认哪份是原件。两个记载也许都在说真话。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch028.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch028",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch028.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch028.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "礁岛老人",
          "text": "最后一节没人敢唱，不是因为难听，是歌里有那晚失踪的人。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch028.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "伊泽",
          "text": "如果家属不愿公开，我可以先记下音符，等他们自己决定。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch029.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch029",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch029.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch029.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "困海船长",
          "text": "我以为自己运气不好，一连三次都走回同一座暗礁。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch029.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "朔弦",
          "text": "那就别再信这块航标。谁改过磁石，谁就该向船队解释。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch030.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch030",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch030.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch030.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "女船主",
          "text": "从前这块石头刻的是所有出海人的名字，现在只剩缴费最多的三家。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch030.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "朔弦",
          "text": "把被磨掉的名字拓出来。新公约不能又变成旧账本。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch031.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch031",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch031.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch031.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "面包学徒",
          "text": "今天卖完的面包，明早会好好摆回一模一样的位置。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch031.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "岚音",
          "text": "库存不会记得昨天，但你会。先把今天卖掉了几条写下来。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch032.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch032",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch032.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch032.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "镜宫照护员",
          "text": "那孩子总说爸爸马上会回来，可没有一次真正迈出门。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch032.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "别先拆掉他的晚餐桌。先问他愿不愿知道外面现在是什么时候。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch033.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch033",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch033.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch033.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "梦庭引路人",
          "text": "这条路能带你回到没说错那句话的早晨，只要你留在里面。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch033.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "玄璃",
          "text": "如果代价是再也见不到明天，我想先听每个人自己回答。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch034.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch034",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch034.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch034.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "剧场清扫工",
          "text": "座牌每夜都会增加，原本空无一人的台下已经坐不下新名字。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch034.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "玄璃",
          "text": "我不想只做他们的座位。我想问剧场外的人今天过得怎样。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch035.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch035",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch035.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch035.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "年轻护理师",
          "text": "我把醒来者名单填好了，却不知道该怎么写他们失去的十二年。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch035.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "岚音",
          "text": "不用把人生写成损坏的钟。先写现在需要的帮助。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch036.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch036",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch036.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch036.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "镜宫旧医官",
          "text": "这里曾有一扇退出门，改造之后却被刻成了墙。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch036.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "玄璃",
          "text": "把原来的门框留下。以后人们应当知道谁决定将它封死。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch037.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch037",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch037.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch037.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "岛上渔童",
          "text": "地图上没有我家，可我母亲说那棵歪树永远会在。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch037.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "朔弦",
          "text": "我认得那棵树，却得先问你们愿不愿让别人找到这里。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch038.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch038",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch038.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch038.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "默契城书记员",
          "text": "一本账里有六代人，我每次翻页都像把别人的日子当作同一天。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch038.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "玄璃",
          "text": "你可以开始写下一页，不需要替他们决定只能用一个名字。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch039.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch039",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch039.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch039.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "裂谷救援员",
          "text": "那个孩子把车票攥得很紧，问我海还会不会在。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch039.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "岚音",
          "text": "我们先替她找水和能睡的地方，再慢慢告诉她海没有消失。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch040.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch040",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch040.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch040.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "岁影见证者",
          "text": "我在城外得救。我的妹妹在城内，她说那是最残忍的一道门。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch040.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "伊泽",
          "text": "我会把两边的证词都留下，不用一首歌替你们选谁正确。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch041.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch041",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch041.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch041.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "树海护林者",
          "text": "第三扇门一直是空的，有人要我照着前两扇补完它。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch041.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "玄璃",
          "text": "别急着落笔。它也许正等着以后会来这里的人。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch042.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch042",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch042.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch042.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "旧洲代表",
          "text": "有人说只要大家统一姓名，历史就不会再吵起来。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch042.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "伊泽",
          "text": "那不是恢复历史，是换一支更整齐的笔把人重新删掉。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch043.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch043",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch043.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch043.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "观测员",
          "text": "每次六灯变亮，天轨那条线就粗一点。我们原本把它当好消息。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch043.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "缇珐",
          "text": "修好灯和谁拿走供能是两回事。这次必须查流向。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch044.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch044",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch044.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch044.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "记忆恢复者",
          "text": "我终于想起丈夫爱吃什么，可他已经在寂潮里失踪了。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch044.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "岚音",
          "text": "记得他不表示你必须立刻高兴。想哭也不需要谁批准。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch045.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch045",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch045.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch045.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "避难街妇人",
          "text": "他们叫我拥护永昼的叛徒，只因为我想再听见丈夫说话。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch045.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "雷索",
          "text": "我们先让这家孩子能走到医馆。你的选择可以在安全的地方继续谈。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch046.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch046",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch046.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch046.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "观测站修理工",
          "text": "指针倒走时这根旧闸杆还在往前拉，像它不认得现在的命令。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch046.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "缇珐",
          "text": "澄舟留下的手动分流可能还有用，先找它通到哪一层。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch047.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch047",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch047.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch047.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "城门车夫",
          "text": "名单写着贵族先走，可我车上有两个不能自己站的伤员。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch047.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "雷索",
          "text": "把伤情和车次公开记下。谁来改名单，都得让等待的人知道。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch048.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch048",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch048.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch048.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "最后一船的厨娘",
          "text": "我准备了够一百人喝的热汤，却不知道还有多少人上不了船。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch048.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "先给已经上船的人分，剩下的请记住名字。我们还会回来找。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    }
  ]
}
